# Complete semantic translation of the historical usbskel.wlcmd.
#
# The four historical callbacks are automatic roots because their addresses
# escape through request callbacks or hotplug registration.  The seven
# bus_ops mappings to warlock_dummy cannot affect usbskel, whose dev_ops has
# no bus_ops vector.
#
# OSLL produces identical analysis and function inventories with and without
# "one usbskel_state".  New locklint already distinguishes concrete object
# identities and needs no declaration for this focused module.
